      <article class="retail-s2__card" data-reveal>
        <span class="retail-s2__ico">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 10-2.3 5.7"></path><path d="M20 5v5h-5"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3 class="h3">Absences before service</h3>
        <p class="txt">Sick calls and swaps land hours before the doors open.</p>
